---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const title = "Terms of Service | FloatJet";
const description =
  "FloatJet terms of service, usage policies, and legal disclaimers for using our website.";
const lastUpdated = "November 23, 2025";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 pt-24 md:pt-28 pb-16 md:pb-20">
    <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto prose prose-invert prose-lg">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-white/60 text-sm mb-8">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

      <p class="text-white/80 lead">
        Welcome to FloatJet. By accessing or using our website, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. Please
        read them carefully before using our site.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-4">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p class="text-white/80">
        By accessing and using FloatJet (floatjet. Com), you accept and agree to be bound by these Terms of Service and
        our Privacy Policy. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use our website.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-4">2.description of Service</h2>
      <p class="text-white/80">
        FloatJet is an informational website that provides reviews, comparisons, guides, and recommendations for
        software, tools, and products primarily focused on remote work and digital nomad lifestyles. Our content is
        intended to help users make informed purchasing decisions.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-4">3. Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
      <p class="text-white/80">
        <strong>Important:</strong> FloatJet participates in affiliate marketing programs. This means we may earn
        commissions when you click on links to products or services on our site and make a purchase. This comes at no
        additional cost to you.
      </p>
      <p class="text-white/80 mt-4">
        Our affiliate relationships include, but are not limited to:
      </p>
      <ul class="text-white/80 space-y-2">
        <li>Impact Radius affiliate network</li>
        <li>ShareASale affiliate network</li>
        <li>CJ Affiliate (Commission Junction)</li>
        <li>Direct affiliate programs with software companies</li>
        <li>Amazon Associates Program</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-white/80 mt-4">
        While we strive to provide honest and unbiased reviews, you should be aware that we have a financial incentive
        when you purchase through our links. We only recommend products we believe provide value, but we encourage you
        to do your own research before making any purchase decisions.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-4">4. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
      <p class="text-white/80">
        The information on FloatJet is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind, either express or implied. We
        make no representations or warranties regarding:
      </p>
      <ul class="text-white/80 space-y-2">
        <li>The accuracy, completeness, or reliability of any content</li>
        <li>The availability or functionality of third-party products or services</li>
        <li>The pricing, features, or availability of products we review</li>
        <li>The suitability of any product or service for your specific needs</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-white/80 mt-4">
        Product information, pricing, and features are subject to change by the respective companies without notice. We
        strive to keep our content up-to-date but cannot guarantee accuracy at all times.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-4">5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p class="text-white/80">
        To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, FloatJet and its owners, operators, and contributors shall
        not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages, including but not
        limited to:
      </p>
      <ul class="text-white/80 space-y-2">
        <li>Loss of profits, revenue, or data</li>
        <li>Business interruption</li>
        <li>Damages arising from your reliance on any information on this site</li>
        <li>Damages arising from purchases made through affiliate links</li>
        <li>Any issues with third-party products or services</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-white/80 mt-4">
        Our total liability for any claims arising from your use of this website shall not exceed the amount you paid to
        access our content (which is zero for free content).
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-4">6. Not Professional Advice</h2>
      <p class="text-white/80">
        The content on FloatJet is for informational purposes only and does not constitute:
      </p>
      <ul class="text-white/80 space-y-2">
        <li>Professional financial advice</li>
        <li>Legal advice</li>
        <li>Tax advice</li>
        <li>Technical consulting services</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-white/80 mt-4">
        Always consult with qualified professionals for advice specific to your situation, especially regarding tax,
        legal, or financial matters related to remote work.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-4">7. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p class="text-white/80">
        All content on FloatJet, including but not limited to text, graphics, logos, images, and software, is the
        property of FloatJet or its content suppliers and is protected by copyright and other intellectual property
        laws.
      </p>
      <p class="text-white/80 mt-4">
        You may not:
      </p>
      <ul class="text-white/80 space-y-2">
        <li>Reproduce, distribute, or republish our content without written permission</li>
        <li>Modify or create derivative works from our content</li>
        <li>Use our content for commercial purposes without authorization</li>
        <li>Remove any copyright or proprietary notices from our content</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-white/80 mt-4">
        Limited personal, non-commercial use such as sharing links or brief quotations with attribution is permitted.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-4">8. Third-Party Links</h2>
      <p class="text-white/80">
        Our website contains links to third-party websites and services. These links are provided for your convenience
        and do not signify endorsement. We have no control over the content, privacy policies, or practices of
        third-party sites and accept no responsibility for them.
      </p>
      <p class="text-white/80 mt-4">
        When you click on a third-party link, you leave our site and are subject to the terms and privacy policies of
        that third-party website.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-4">9. User Conduct</h2>
      <p class="text-white/80">
        When using FloatJet, you agree not to:
      </p>
      <ul class="text-white/80 space-y-2">
        <li>Use the site for any unlawful purpose</li>
        <li>Attempt to gain unauthorized access to our systems</li>
        <li>Interfere with or disrupt the website's operation</li>
        <li>Scrape, crawl, or harvest content without permission</li>
        <li>Transmit viruses or malicious code</li>
        <li>Impersonate any person or entity</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-4">10. Changes to Terms</h2>
      <p class="text-white/80">
        We reserve the right to modify these Terms of Service at any time. Changes will be effective immediately upon
        posting to the website. Your continued use of FloatJet after any changes constitutes acceptance of the new
        terms.
      </p>
      <p class="text-white/80 mt-4">
        We encourage you to review these terms periodically for updates.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-4">11. Governing Law</h2>
      <p class="text-white/80">
        These Terms of Service shall be governed by and construed in accordance with applicable laws, without regard to
        conflict of law principles. Any disputes arising from these terms or your use of the website shall be resolved
        through appropriate legal channels.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-4">12. Severability</h2>
      <p class="text-white/80">
        If any provision of these Terms of Service is found to be unenforceable or invalid, that provision shall be
        limited or eliminated to the minimum extent necessary, and the remaining provisions shall remain in full force
        and effect.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-4">13. Contact Information</h2>
      <p class="text-white/80">
        If you have any questions about these Terms of Service, please contact us at:
      </p>
      <p class="text-white/80 mt-4">
        <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:legal@floatjet. Com"
                                   class="text-sky-light hover:text-white transition-colors">legal@floatjet. Com</a>
      </p>

      <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-white/10">
        <p class="text-white/60 text-sm">
          These Terms of Service are effective as of {lastUpdated}.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
